text.section:
Funds allocated to this program under § 33.2-358 shall be distributed to each highway construction district for that district's grant program as follows:

Thirty percent based on the ratio of the population of the cities and towns eligible to receive payments pursuant to § 33.2-319 within a highway construction district to the total population of the cities and towns eligible to receive payments pursuant to § 33.2-319 within the Commonwealth;


Twenty-eight percent based on the ratio of vehicle miles traveled on primary highways within the highway construction district to the total vehicle miles traveled on primary highways in the Commonwealth;


Twenty-four percent based on the ratio of the population of counties within a highway construction district to the total population of all counties within the Commonwealth;


Ten percent based on the ratio of the number of primary lane-miles in the highway construction district to the total number of primary lane-miles within the Commonwealth;


Six percent based on the ratio of the land area of counties within the highway construction district to the total land area of counties within the Commonwealth; and


Two percent based on a primary need factor based on addressing the largest under-allocation to highway construction districts relative to primary needs.
